                                                "example_id": "cf7c7534-e305-4343-95f2-63554a6f7a93",
                                                "sense_id": "f6b43de2-76ee-3124-88a7-cd3ddc095a76",
                                                "text": "“So you'll all be near New York!” Maggie says. “We don't know for sure yet.” Sara stresses. “Don't jinx it.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e53babe7-e655-46d1-a76c-54d24ffb4545",
                                                "sense_id": "f6b43de2-76ee-3124-88a7-cd3ddc095a76",
                                                "text": "I've no idea if she guessed what I was intending to do. I don't know why I was so reluctant to talk about it, even to her. Maybe I was afraid that verbalising my intentions would jinx it in some way."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "jinx",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c54123d8-a821-3720-8122-19e460295c0d",
                                        "entry_id": "cdcd714c-987d-37b1-9ccc-b5a7ea4c5a72",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used after the same thing is said by two people simultaneously."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0b42815-76b3-434b-9bd0-8c303e4001d5",
                                                "sense_id": "c54123d8-a821-3720-8122-19e460295c0d",
                                                "text": "Bart: I'm telling Mom and Dad! / Lisa: You're telling who? / Bart: Mom and Dad! / Girls: MOM AND DAD? JINX! / Janey Powell: Now you can't talk, 'til somebody says your name!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4cfe1092-8f45-4082-b5df-d09575a4e34b",
                        "source_entry_id": "a9e135da-9cd9-3fd2-8c1b-a29967249a24",
                        "source_sense_id": "b8d1688f-99b0-329f-bba3-da0b7cae740b",
                        "source_sense_description": "glückloser Mensch",
                        "target_lang_word": "oiseau de mauvais augure",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "oiseau de mauvais augure",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "56e48c2e-ac57-34f1-addb-678a0c2cf572",
                                        "entry_id": "0a98215a-7305-3a4f-86f8-18b3886509c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Oiseau qui serait de mauvais présage ; oiseau de malheur."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
                                            "literally"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "23a2b30d-c557-3a17-9d70-536a3587997d",
                                        "entry_id": "0a98215a-7305-3a4f-86f8-18b3886509c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne ou évènement qui serait de mauvais présage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ec7281c-80b9-4ea9-a039-43f2334fe835",
                                                "sense_id": "23a2b30d-c557-3a17-9d70-536a3587997d",
                                                "text": "Si elle leur permettait de sortir dans le monde extérieur, des choses terribles arriveraient. Les manchots n’y avaient pas leur place. Mais elle l’avait toujours dit avec beaucoup d’amour. « Mon petit manchot qui porte la poisse », disait-elle. « Mon petit oiseau de mauvais augure. »"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85d691a5-8af7-4b8a-8c70-ddd5b034fb44",
                                                "sense_id": "23a2b30d-c557-3a17-9d70-536a3587997d",
                                                "text": "Il y aura toujours des oiseaux de mauvais augure qui feront leur miel de ce type d’événement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03023cdb-7695-434c-8432-bdb37409ed48",
                                                "sense_id": "23a2b30d-c557-3a17-9d70-536a3587997d",
                                                "text": "Il ne supportait plus cette cassandre mortifère, cet oiseau de mauvais augure qui venait sans cesse lui rappeler que le petit souffrait. Et que c’était entièrement de sa faute."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "268e0cec-4829-4b75-8d58-e3999168568c",
                                                "sense_id": "23a2b30d-c557-3a17-9d70-536a3587997d",
                                                "text": "Des oiseaux de mauvais augure font croire que tout cela ne sera plus possible avant longtemps, qu’il va falloir bouleverser les fondements de la vie en société…"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
